    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71030" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοσ-άζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be ill,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.302
			</span></i>:—also in 
				Med.
			, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγιάζομαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				229b3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> causal,
				<i>produce sickness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ νοσάζοντα αἴτια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.208
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				140
			</span></i>.</div>
